  "prefLabel": "Rev 2910.02 Anonymity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2910.02 Anonymity.\n\n(a) A taxpayer may remain anonymous to the department while requesting to participate in the program by coming forward through a representative.\n\n(b) A taxpayer coming forward through a representative to request to participate in the program shall remain anonymous until the time when the taxpayer signs the voluntary disclosure agreement.\n\nSource. #11142, eff 7-26-16; ss by #13660, eff 6-21-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2900.html"
